          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu ũthatu wa Yeova wakanĩa Isilaeli, nake amathoosya kw’okonĩ kwa Kusani‐lisathaimu mũsumbĩ wa Mesovotamia: na ana ma Isilaeli mamũthũkũma Kusani‐lisathaimu myaka nyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
