          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla ana ma Isilaeli mamwĩkaĩlile Yeova, Yeova amaũngamĩsya ana ma Isilaeli mũtangĩĩi, ũla wamatangĩĩe, nake nĩ Othinieli mwana wa Kenasi, mũinae we Kalevu. ",
