        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Isilaeli meeka ĩngĩ ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku: na Yeova amwĩkĩa Ekeloni mũsumbĩ wa Moavi vinya okite na Isilaeli, nũndũ nĩmekĩte ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
