            "sid": "JDG 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ yĩla ana ma Isilaeli mamwĩkaĩlile Yeova, we Yeova amaũngamĩsya mũtangĩĩi, o Euti mwana wa Ngela, ũla Mũmbenyamini, mũndũ waĩ kĩmotho. Na ana ma Isilaeli mamũtwaĩa Ekeloni mũsumbĩ wa Moavi mũvothi na kw’oko kwa ũsu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
